{"title":"Good Day Curiosity Spacer Cradle Pre-Sale","link":"https://theradavist.com/good-day-curiosity-spacer-cradle-pre-sale","date":1788359108000,"content":"<p><img loading=\"lazy\" src=\"/media/14052a9509ec5a66f46caa99acfe2336cf88f3970a2d8c94cb38a488584fb2cb.jpg\" srcset=\"/media/e401a2dbd8b339a42520a0390c8520b15b0da8f37384a4f38091f649575551b5.jpg 640w, /media/14052a9509ec5a66f46caa99acfe2336cf88f3970a2d8c94cb38a488584fb2cb.jpg 1800w, /media/f839b192f9d67e357a1a46b05f265ee9097483017499bb77e2003ed9275e1915.jpg\" /></p>\n<p><em>Gunnison, Colorado-based <a href=\"https://theradavist.com/tag/good-day\" target=\"_blank\">Good Day Curiosity</a> just launched a pre-sale for its <a href=\"https://www.gooddaycuriosity.com/product-page/spacer-bag-cradle\" target=\"_blank\">Spacer Cradle</a> steerer-mounted bag harness ($200)…</em><span></span></p>\n<p><img loading=\"lazy\" src=\"/media/fecd5d05742aaab93a63050db6e2522dce4948e9ecbb2649e215831c0f8046fd.jpg\" srcset=\"/media/a42415c1697757e4e68ee50aa4ade6b30cd0ea1c51e5d861fd7da8d1052462a6.jpg 800w, /media/22f15619e18f4419f8176e5c16e88b4ef491a567e9194aeb064e6e8223ef1371.jpg 1600w, /media/fecd5d05742aaab93a63050db6e2522dce4948e9ecbb2649e215831c0f8046fd.jpg\" /><img loading=\"lazy\" src=\"/media/621e60fdbff7effc0facb2ec1005da10d763e03f1de8cf7ed8a98ba7ea622291.jpg\" srcset=\"/media/da9de8729269043e7f3759f5e8e94c4485673caedfd38ae9cc214fbd1b4dbf9c.jpg 800w, /media/a54c779e029ebc1e99fde8185239bf23bb66de780f53de578cb2d2a0e8a8dfce.jpg 1600w, /media/621e60fdbff7effc0facb2ec1005da10d763e03f1de8cf7ed8a98ba7ea622291.jpg\" /></p>\n<p>Spacer Cradle cleans up your cockpit area, freeing your handlebars from floppy soft handlebar harnesses. Installation takes as long as changing your spacer stack height. Simply remove the top cap, stem, and spacers, slide the cradle onto the stem where the spacers were, then reassemble and tighten. The torque spec for the cradle is 5 Nm.</p>\n<p><img loading=\"lazy\" src=\"/media/70f8e9a288f7f2e29025e6c92170f915d6e708f5cf25d6da2c262538e37a8c48.jpg\" srcset=\"/media/490970318bb40e60e410e2b1cd0df4babd2865e56ac51e11b2739d761967a85c.jpg 800w, /media/70f8e9a288f7f2e29025e6c92170f915d6e708f5cf25d6da2c262538e37a8c48.jpg 1600w, /media/fad776a9b158a210bc9c326140a07eaf08f907a5b9ee710909b15721e7630f7d.jpg\" /><img loading=\"lazy\" src=\"/media/e2a0f0b78cd0509308466a7548b7bef39abfe5b867ad82b81bf6a02ff6ccad12.jpg\" srcset=\"/media/9447421a022d53de33ce1f269c108e37956a65da5ec7585f15c8a87ab053bd0a.jpg 800w, /media/e2a0f0b78cd0509308466a7548b7bef39abfe5b867ad82b81bf6a02ff6ccad12.jpg 1600w, /media/091734d65a43338bfe854d36627813fe1649cf5316f07b4a968b3f9601e422c5.jpg\" /><img loading=\"lazy\" src=\"/media/6cf245e9c1fcbbcc95903825ed24f24c85e3bac912ffdca16fca16e8e5518e01.jpg\" srcset=\"/media/feedd9be4b93c30230bf80c1ef1767dc4ac7a31198fe1a6013ed46190b7275e0.jpg 800w, /media/6cf245e9c1fcbbcc95903825ed24f24c85e3bac912ffdca16fca16e8e5518e01.jpg 1600w, /media/daff8b458acc0c3e406fe1899257242c0590e53d855003ab528e9ac6c5beee01.jpg\" /></p>\n<p>This neat rack replaces a 20 mm spacer, is 230 mm wide, and is compatible with any stuff sack or roll-top bag with a circumference of 760 mm (30 inches) or less. It has strap guides for quick on- and off-bag attachment, and the order includes 2 static straps.</p>\n<p>Ordering the Spacer Cradle is easy. Good Day is running a pre-sale that is open until September 22nd, with a Christmas-ish delivery.</p>\n<p><strong>Specs:</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li>Weight: 230 g</li>\n<li>Made from 4130 chromoly with a black powder coat finish (custom colors available with purchase of a custom Goodday frame)</li>\n<li>Only works on threadless 1″ or 1 1/8″ headsets.</li>\n</ul>\n<p>Check out more at <a href=\"https://www.gooddaycuriosity.com/product-page/spacer-bag-cradle\" target=\"_blank\">Good Day Curiosity</a>.</p>\n<p>The post <a href=\"https://theradavist.com/good-day-curiosity-spacer-cradle-pre-sale\">Good Day Curiosity Spacer Cradle Pre-Sale</a> appeared first on <a href=\"https://cms.theradavist.com/\">The Radavist</a>.</p>","author":"John Watson","comments":"https://theradavist.com/good-day-curiosity-spacer-cradle-pre-sale#respond","siteTitle":"The Radavist","siteHash":"96eb481d8084f04a4602bac57874ba717baf56b758f45547b5caf2312da766ef","entryHash":"96485a00ecc6432159fadbffe36b98cd0c0bd05cf80ad8df5a9f27e8f77afaa3","category":"Cycling"}